      "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group testimonial-content-inner has-c-brand-primary-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:30px;border-top-right-radius:30px;border-bottom-right-radius:30px\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center testimonial-highlight is-style-h1 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>&#8220;They were very comforting and helpful&#8221;</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center testimonial-paragraph wp-block-paragraph\">&#8220;After losing my parents I had to sell their home. It was a very hard decision to make, but this company stood out to me and made the process super smooth! They were very comforting and helpful and I thank them for doing this as quickly as possible for my siblings and I!&#8221;</p>\n</div></div>\n",
